<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to speak in parliament from 0902 GMT.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to speak in parliament from 0902 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a parliamentary committee meeting at 6.02 p.m. (0902 GMT) on Tuesday, the BOJ said in a statement.</p>
<p>Matsushita is scheduled to answer questions from a member of the Lower House's finance committee between 6.02 p.m. and 6.27 p.m. (0902-0927 GMT), the BOJ said.</p>
</text>
